{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio","s":"Hey you Gregorians, check this out!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Lesquels de ces mois ont 31 jours ?"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio","s":"Of course the Gregorian calendar was commissioned by Pope Gregory XIII, also the patron saint of refrigerator magnets."}]}
